
# 🎥 AI Video & Text Summarization System with Face Authentication

 📌 Overview

An AI-powered Django web application that generates smart summaries for YouTube videos and long text content using Natural Language Processing (NLP) and Transformer-based Deep Learning models.

The system also includes Face Recognition Authentication, premium subscription management, history tracking, and feedback analysis.

---

 🚀 Problem Solved

Reading lengthy documents and watching long educational videos consumes time.

This system solves that by:

* Generating instant AI-based summaries
* Extracting YouTube transcripts automatically
* Summarizing large text efficiently
* Providing secure face-recognition login

---

 🧠 AI / ML Models Used

 Abstractive Summarization

* `facebook/bart-large-cnn` (Hugging Face Transformers)

 Extractive Summarization

* NLTK Tokenization
* Word Frequency Analysis
* Stopword Removal

 Face Authentication

* Face Recognition Encoding & Matching

---

 📊 Input Sources

* YouTube Video URLs
* Long Text Documents
* Live Webcam Face Capture

