---

 ⚙️ AI Workflow

 Video Summary

1. Extract transcript / description
2. Tokenize text
3. Extract important sentences
4. Generate abstractive summary using BART

 Text Summary

1. Text preprocessing
2. Frequency-based extraction
3. Transformer summarization
4. Final concise output

 Face Login

1. Capture webcam image
2. Generate face encoding
3. Compare stored encoding
4. Authenticate user

